{"about_the_game":"Johnny Chainsaw is a single player puzzle platformer where players don\u2019t have a jump button. Immerse yourself in this world of power structures, ethical dilemmas, and struggles in responding to change.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Jump Button</h2>Use the world to navigate obstacles and levels. How can you use the world to cross this gap without a jump button?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711840/extras/3f145f544afd394a6a8ae61323f2cd83.poster.avif?t=1680040927\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711840/extras/3f145f544afd394a6a8ae61323f2cd83.webm?t=1680040927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711840/extras/3f145f544afd394a6a8ae61323f2cd83.mp4?t=1680040927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Modes<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Story mode: A discovery at the center of the planet, a response hampered by power struggles, and the inevitable change that threatens the world. You decide what happens to the inhabitants of Corut and how their lives will be forever changed.<br></li><li>Standard mode: Complete the game without story mode elements. Perfect for streaming, speedrunning, or enjoying weird platforming mechanics without narrative screens interrupting game flow.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>40 short levels<br></li><li>6 boss fights<br></li><li>Death counter and timer<br></li><li>Collectables<br></li><li>Character Sheets<br></li><li>Rich story and Custscenes (story mode only)<br></li><li>Quick resets after character death - get right back in the action<br></li><li>Achievements</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decide the Fate of the World (Story Mode Only)</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711840/extras/9fba1da7fb2c4f52a4e97865a8d37601.poster.avif?t=1680040927\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711840/extras/9fba1da7fb2c4f52a4e97865a8d37601.webm?t=1680040927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/711840/extras/9fba1da7fb2c4f52a4e97865a8d37601.mp4?t=1680040927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>When Yarbor's lead researcher Ivan discovers a change at the planet's core, a power struggle ensues at the company. This conflict forever changes the lives of all mechanics and organics on Corut. <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Reveal Ivan's discovery<br></li><li>Explore the power struggle and its ramifications<br></li><li>Recognize your part in the this conflict<br></li><li>Resolve the conflict and change life on Corut forever</li></ul></h2></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"e0d8b69bac51c6f80bf852bd50d5f602e3545b2c.jpg","localized_name":"Power On","name":"Power On","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/711840/e0d8b69bac51c6f80bf852bd50d5f602e3545b2c.jpg"},{"icon":"e55fb65c487ad64a6519fb0807803ab4ac773413.jpg","localized_name":"Pizza Delivery","name":"Pizza Delivery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/711840/e55fb65c487ad64a6519fb0807803ab4ac773413.jpg"},{"icon":"27519060a307aaab3265f725ae46bfe2847ece54.jpg","localized_name":"Free Hugs","name":"Free Hugs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/711840/27519060a307aaab3265f725ae46bfe2847ece54.jpg"},{"icon":"6f5f425e1b398f42313dd8de5ded2d162f674457.jpg","localized_name":"Nice Jump Human","name":"Nice Jump Human","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/711840/6f5f425e1b398f42313dd